      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "cold open",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I'm Rohaan from Humanitarians AI. This is Part 5. You can make one good image now. This part is about making the next twenty look like they belong with it. Midjourney has four different tools for that, and most of them switch on in the same place.",
