      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "Act 2 — a reference image",
      "narration_text": "The picture icon at the left of the bar opens four slots. Two of them matter here. Style reference uses the style of an image. Image Prompts uses the elements of an image. Those are Midjourney's own words, and the difference is the whole thing. One borrows how a picture looks. The other borrows what is in it.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 23,
      "shot": {
