      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "Act 4 — a board opened",
      "narration_text": "Open one and there are three ways to put pictures in. Upload from your computer, paste a link from the web, or pick from what you have already made here. Hover any tile to throw it out again. And two ways to use the board: Set as Default applies it to everything next, Use in Prompt applies it once.",
