    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "Act 5 — a personalization profile",
      "narration_text": "Personalize, in the sidebar, is different again. Midjourney puts it well: inside every prompt are unspoken details, and it fills them in to please everybody. A profile makes it fill them in to please you instead. It ships switched off. And it does nothing at all until you have ranked your way to two hundred points.",
